---
/**
 * Tag-filter chip bar for the bookshelf. Server-renders an empty
 * shell — the actual chips are injected by the client script in
 * `book-list.astro` once the book list is in hand, so the counts
 * always reflect the *current* set of books (not stale data).
 *
 * Keep this component dumb: it provides a stable target for
 * `getElementById("bookshelf-tag-bar")` and a sensible empty state.
 */
---

<ul
  id="bookshelf-tag-bar"
  class="bookshelf-tags flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"
  aria-label="filtrar por tag"
  data-empty="cargando tags…"
>
  <li>
    <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-dim">cargando tags…</span>
  </li>
</ul>
